      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After observing the issue a bit more, it seems like it depends on the angle from which you're looking at the person typing.\n\nThe attached image is a representation of the in-game screen (1080p in my case). The green area is where the typing indicator does appear, and the red area is where it doesn't. This is when my POV is at a similar height as the person typing and changes when I go up or down. Not exact measurements, just eyeballed.",
