  "created": "2022-12-08T18:59:41.956Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When someone is typing a message, the typing indicator (the three dots) does not appear below their nameplate anymore, but their nameplate still moves up like it used to. However, this bug does not happen if they already have a message below their nameplate (as in, the indicator still appears on the right of the message).",
